            "text": "DM-2591 is evidence-only: this publicOwnerJoin contract records the exact DOM/CSSOM facts a later production ticket may consume, while the retained private four-arm corpus remains the Resource-pointer authority. It admits only SVG href and a single ordinary url() at an explicit computed-property index; image-set, pseudo, shadow, cache, service-worker, and non-unique ledger relations remain denied.",
